WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.994
Want a different drum character? Press A, then hold Menu and press pad sixteen. We're changing the sounds, keeping the beat.

2
00:00:07.054 --> 00:00:13.026
Shift and Menu opens Browse. The library is where your samples, kits, and saved projects live.

3
00:00:13.026 --> 00:00:19.021
Hold Shift and pad eleven to show Kits. The pad labels on screen tell you what each library shortcut does.

4
00:00:19.021 --> 00:00:25.295
Pad fourteen selects the second kit in this library. Press the data dial to load it onto the selected track.

5
00:00:25.295 --> 00:00:31.291
Back to Main, then pad thirteen. Same pattern, different kit. That can change the whole feel of a part.

6
00:00:31.291 --> 00:00:37.094
Stop, Undo to compare, and Shift Undo to bring the new kit back. The other tracks keep their sounds.
